index 44415f24..f610d9fd 100644
--- a/drivers/misc/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/misc/Kconfig
@@ -83,6 +83,13 @@ config GATEWORKS_SC
 	  boards to provide a boot watchdog, power control, temperature monitor,
